## State Machine

```
                    ┌──────────┐
                    │  TITLE   │
                    └────┬─────┘
                         │ start_pressed
                         ▼
               ┌─────────────────┐
          ┌────│    PLAYING      │────┐
          │    └────────┬────────┘    │
          │ esc_pressed │             │ win/lose
          ▼             │             ▼
    ┌──────────┐        │     ┌────────────┐
    │  PAUSED  │        │     │  GAME_OVER │
    └────┬─────┘        │     └─────┬──────┘
         │ resume       │           │ restart / quit
         └──────────────┘           │
                                    ▼
                              ┌──────────┐
                              │  TITLE   │
                              └──────────┘
```

## Transition Table

| Current state | Input / Event | Next state | Side effects |
|---------------|---------------|------------|-------------|
| `title` | `start_pressed` | `playing` | Reset score, spawn player, start timer |
| `playing` | `esc_pressed` / `pause_btn` | `paused` | Freeze game loop, show pause menu |
| `playing` | `win_condition` | `game_over(win)` | Stop timer, save score, show win panel |
| `playing` | `lose_condition` | `game_over(lose)` | Stop timer, show lose panel |
| `paused` | `resume_pressed` | `playing` | Unfreeze game loop |
| `paused` | `quit_pressed` | `title` | Destroy game session |
| `game_over` | `restart_pressed` | `playing` | Full reset, new session |
| `game_over` | `quit_pressed` | `title` | Destroy game session |

## Input Bindings

| Action | Keyboard | Touch | Gamepad |
|--------|----------|-------|---------|
| Move left | `ArrowLeft` / `A` | D-pad left | Left stick |
| Move right | `ArrowRight` / `D` | D-pad right | Left stick |
| Jump / Move up | `ArrowUp` / `W` | D-pad up | A button |
| Action / Shoot | `Space` / `Click` | A button | X button |
| Dash | `Shift` | Swipe | B button |
| Pause | `Escape` | Pause icon | Start |

**Input model:** Keyboard events via `keydown`/`keyup` with key state map. Touch via `pointerdown`/`pointermove`/`pointerup` for unified mouse+touch. No per-frame event checks.

## Deep Link / URL State (web only)

| URL param | Effect |
|-----------|--------|
| `?level=2` | Skip to level 2 (dev/QA only) |
